  "caveat_scheduler_log_ordering": "The Cloud Scheduler AttemptStarted/AttemptFinished entries for this tick carry log timestamps of 2026-08-31T12:00:42.42Z and 12:00:42.45Z - AFTER the wake at 12:00:38.760070Z. That is expected: those execution records are written once the publish completes, so their log timestamps lag the actual publish. The causal ordering must be read off scheduledTime (12:00:35.692552Z), which is carried inside the AttemptStarted payload and is the time the tick fired. A reader who compares only the log timestamps will wrongly conclude the ordering is impossible.",
